      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've noticed sometimes my starter just goes completely bad or smells weirdly off for no reason, even when i follow the temperature stuff. is there anything else that can mess with the microbial balance? like could something \"unseen\" or bad stuff in the air go in there and just ruin the whole ecosystem of the starter?",
